Package: Ramses
Title: Modern Graphical User Interface for Statistical Analysis in R
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person(
    "census-specs", role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "census-specs@users.noreply.github.com"
  )
Description: Modern graphical user interface built with Shiny and bslib for
    interactive statistical analysis in R. Ramses provides guided data import,
    descriptive statistics, statistical tests, regression models, interactive
    visualisation with ggplot2 and Plotly, and an R Markdown journal designed to
    support reproducible analysis.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
RoxygenNote: 7.3.1
